   "id": 674063,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Discuss the psychological process of dying, focusing on the various ways individuals cope with the awareness of their impending death. How do different coping mechanisms, such as Kübler-Ross’s stages of grief or other models, help individuals come to terms with death? Provide examples to illustrate how people might progress through these stages or employ these mechanisms. Finally, reflect on the value of Kübler-Ross’s research, citing some of its limitations.",
